Draft title: {{ $json.draft.title }}
Review summary: score {{ $json.score }}, review_status approved, revision rounds used {{ $json.round }}.
Research dossier attached: {{ $json.dossier ? 'yes' : 'no' }}

Package this approved deliverable. Return title, delivery_note (short client-facing note) and status. Do not alter the approved content.

Note: in this n8n workflow you have no callable tools; perform the steps of your workflow yourself and return only the structured result.
